  "worked_solution": "The complement of $Y,$ denoted $\\overset{\u2015}{Y},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $Y.$\n\nThe universal set $U$ consists of the letters $a$ through $z,$ while the set $Y$ consists of the letters $a$ through $j.$\n\nSo, the only elements of $U$ that are not in $Y$ are the letters $k$ through $z.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $Y$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{\u2015}{Y}={k,l,m,\u2026,z}.\n$$",
